#: ../../nexus-qualification-transport-20261018-r1/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:67
msgid ""
"解析器拒绝其他 controller、endpoint 别名、空或重复列表、未知字段、其他 clock/cache 配置及 OS。该选择只生成一个私有 "
"domain 和一个生命周期 lease；不选 `[power]` 的 装配没有这组状态和运行期接口。现有 ClockDomain "
"组件仍为唯一借用机制，不新增驱动 ops、公开 provider storage、后台任务或逐请求转发层。"
msgstr ""
"The resolver rejects other controllers, endpoint aliases, empty or duplicate"
" lists, unknown fields, other clock/cache configurations and OS backends. "
"The selection emits one private domain and one lifecycle lease; assemblies "
"without `[power]` have neither this state nor the runtime interfaces. The "
"existing ClockDomain component remains the sole borrowing mechanism, with no"
" new driver ops, public provider storage, background task or per-request "
"forwarding layer."

#: ../../nexus-qualification-transport-20261018-r1/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:72
msgid ""
"生成的 `nx_platform_runtime_domain()` 只返回静态身份，不初始化硬件。Platform 启动 在第一个外设资源写入前获取 "
"lease。即使请求已 acquire-observed SETTLED，初始化的 provider、IRQ、DMA、CS、引脚和外围 gate "
"仍承担责任，因此该 lease 继续保留。 `nx_platform_runtime_pause()` 关闭接纳并复用真实 stop 路径；active"
" 请求返回 BUSY， 调用者必须继续真实 cancel/service 和重试。DMA EN、地址与 mux、owned IRQ、线上完成、 "
"CS/SCK、引脚快照以及自有 gate 的撤回全部证明后，才能 release 并通过 quiescent。 地址、CS、引脚或 gate "
"拒绝恢复时保持 lease 和清理责任，不以清零内存假装停止。"
msgstr ""
"The generated `nx_platform_runtime_domain()` returns only a static identity "
"and does not initialize hardware. Platform startup acquires the lease before"
" the first peripheral resource write. Even after acquire-observed request "
"SETTLED, the initialized provider, IRQ, DMA, CS, pins and peripheral gates "
"retain responsibilities, so the lease remains held. "
"`nx_platform_runtime_pause()` closes admission and reuses the actual stop "
"path; an active request returns BUSY, and the caller must continue actual "
"cancel/service and retry. Release and quiescence are allowed only after "
"proving DMA EN, address and mux withdrawal, owned IRQ withdrawal, wire "
"completion, CS/SCK handoff, pin snapshot restoration and removal of owned "
"gates. Refused address, CS, pin or gate restoration retains the lease and "
"cleanup responsibility; zeroing memory never substitutes for stopping."

#: ../../nexus-qualification-transport-20261018-r1/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:80
msgid ""
"唯一生命周期 owner 必须先 join submitters、controls 和 observers，再在 privileged、 "
"unmasked Thread 串行调用 pause/resume。close 不会自动阻止已初始化 endpoint 的提交， 因此这不是并发的全局 "
"suspend。`nx_platform_runtime_resume()` 只有在排空后提升 admission epoch，再重新获取 lease "
"和恢复原控制器；部分失败分别返回 primary、cleanup 和 remaining-effects，原责任只能由实际 pause 或全局 stop"
" 完成。旧 barrier 不能批准新 epoch。"
msgstr ""
"The sole lifecycle owner must first join submitters, controls and observers,"
" then call pause/resume serially in privileged, unmasked Thread context. "
"Closing the domain does not automatically prevent submission through an "
"initialized endpoint, so this is not concurrent global suspend. "
"`nx_platform_runtime_resume()` advances the admission epoch only after "
"drain, then reacquires the lease and restores the original controller. A "
"partial failure reports primary, cleanup and remaining-effects separately; "
"the original responsibility can be completed only through actual pause or "
"global stop. An old barrier cannot approve a new epoch."

#: ../../nexus-qualification-transport-20261018-r1/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:86
msgid ""
"pause/resume 保持 System 与 TIM2 的 CEN、分频及 overflow owner，不切换 Core deadline "
"时域。暂停期间到期的原绝对 deadline 在恢复后仍然到期。全局 `nx_platform_stop()` 仍是 "
"另一条全消费者停止路径，不能拿它替代运行期暂停或继承其重启前的 deadline。本切片没有 改变 PLL、供电、Flash latency、内核 "
"Tick，也没有实现 WFI、deep STOP、DVFS、GPIO sleep/wake 电气策略或其他板卡的时钟能力。"
msgstr ""
"Pause/resume preserves System and TIM2 CEN, prescaling and overflow "
"ownership without changing the Core deadline domain. An original absolute "
"deadline that expires during pause remains expired after resume. Global "
"`nx_platform_stop()` remains a separate all-consumer stop path; it cannot "
"replace runtime pause or preserve deadlines across its restart. This slice "
"changes neither PLL, supply, Flash latency nor kernel Tick. It does not "
"implement WFI, deep STOP, DVFS, GPIO sleep/wake electrical policy or clock "
"capabilities for other boards."

#: ../../nexus-qualification-transport-20261018-r1/docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:92
msgid ""
"新增 Google 程序连接正常生成的同一装配、真实 H743 System/SPI/GPIO/DMA/ClockDomain 和外部 MMIO/IRQ"
" 模型。它检查跨 SETTLED 的 lease、pending RX commit、失败重试、实际 门控与引脚撤回，以及暂停期间 TIM2 的 "
"pending wrap。软件模型执行和后续 Debug/ASan 结果不构成 MCU、功耗、WCET、clean SDK 或物理 HIL "
"资格；IO-30 的完整退出条件仍待验收。"
msgstr ""
"The new Google program connects the same normally generated assembly to the "
"actual H743 System/SPI/GPIO/DMA/ClockDomain providers and external MMIO/IRQ "
"models. It checks leases retained across SETTLED, pending RX commits, "
"failure retries, actual gate and pin withdrawal, and pending TIM2 wrap "
"during pause. Software model and subsequent Debug/ASan results do not "
"establish MCU execution, power, WCET, clean SDK or physical HIL "
"qualification; the complete IO-30 exit conditions remain to be verified."
